{
  "format": 1,
  "title": "Change the Default Controls",
  "summary": "Give a button your own commands: slide the cube left and right, grow it up and down, at the speed you choose.",
  "order": 2,
  "practice": "../_scenes/cube_region.blend",
  "steps": [
    {
      "title": "Step 1: Pick the Button",
      "text": [
        "1. In the Kneady tab, click the arrow beside Region 1.",
        "2. Click Button 1 under it.",
        "",
        "Button 1 is the button you dragged in Quick Start. Its settings show under the list."
      ],
      "media": [
        {
          "file": "01_pick.mp4",
          "label": "In the Kneady tab",
          "paragraph": 0,
          "recorded": {
            "blender": "5.2",
            "kneady": "1.0.0"
          }
        }
      ],
      "done_when": [
        {
          "path": "window_manager.kneady_row",
          "is": 1
        }
      ],
      "start": {
        "mode": "OBJECT",
        "select": [
          "Cube"
        ],
        "active": "Cube",
        "set": [
          {
            "path": "scene.kneady_on",
            "value": true
          },
          {
            "path": "objects[\"Cube\"].kneady.regions[0].tree_open",
            "value": false
          },
          {
            "path": "window_manager.kneady_row",
            "value": -1
          }
        ],
        "sidebar": "Kneady",
        "view": {
          "location": [
            0.0,
            0.0,
            0.0
          ],
          "rotation": [
            0.71238,
            0.44106,
            0.28736,
            0.46412
          ],
          "distance": 10.0,
          "perspective": "PERSP"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "title": "Step 2: Left and Right Slides It",
      "text": [
        "1. Under Left / Right, click Rotate Y to open its command.",
        "2. Set Drives to Move.",
        "3. Click Y.",
        "",
        "Dragging left and right now slides the cube along Y, which runs left to right in this view, instead of turning it."
      ],
      "media": [
        {
          "file": "02_slide.mp4",
          "label": "In the Kneady tab",
          "paragraph": 0,
          "recorded": {
            "blender": "5.2",
            "kneady": "1.0.0"
          }
        }
      ],
      "highlight": [
        "objects[\"Cube\"].kneady.regions[0].buttons[0].across.kind"
      ],
      "done_when": [
        {
          "path": "objects[\"Cube\"].kneady.regions[0].buttons[0].across.kind",
          "is": "MOVE"
        },
        {
          "path": "objects[\"Cube\"].kneady.regions[0].buttons[0].across.axis",
          "is": "Y"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Step 3: Up and Down Grows It",
      "text": [
        "1. Under Up / Down, click Rotate X to open its command.",
        "2. Set Drives to Scale.",
        "3. Click All.",
        "",
        "Dragging up grows the cube on all three axes; dragging down shrinks it."
      ],
      "media": [
        {
          "file": "03_grow.mp4",
          "label": "In the Kneady tab",
          "paragraph": 0,
          "recorded": {
            "blender": "5.2",
            "kneady": "1.0.0"
          }
        }
      ],
      "highlight": [
        "objects[\"Cube\"].kneady.regions[0].buttons[0].up.kind"
      ],
      "done_when": [
        {
          "path": "objects[\"Cube\"].kneady.regions[0].buttons[0].up.kind",
          "is": "SCALE"
        },
        {
          "path": "objects[\"Cube\"].kneady.regions[0].buttons[0].up.axis",
          "is": "ALL"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Step 4: Choose Its Speed",
      "text": [
        "1. Click Up / Down's Speed.",
        "2. Type 0.1 and press Enter.",
        "",
        "Speed is how far a drag of 100 pixels takes it. At 0.1 the cube grows by about a tenth, so it's easier to stop where you want."
      ],
      "media": [
        {
          "file": "04_speed.mp4",
          "label": "In the Kneady tab",
          "paragraph": 0,
          "recorded": {
            "blender": "5.2",
            "kneady": "1.0.0"
          }
        }
      ],
      "highlight": [
        "objects[\"Cube\"].kneady.regions[0].buttons[0].up.rate"
      ],
      "done_when": [
        {
          "path": "objects[\"Cube\"].kneady.regions[0].buttons[0].up.rate",
          "at_most": 0.15
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Step 5: Try It",
      "text": [
        "1. Hover over the cube's top and drag its button left and right: the cube slides.",
        "2. Drag it up and down: the cube grows and shrinks.",
        "",
        "Ctrl+Z puts it back, a drag at a time."
      ],
      "media": [
        {
          "file": "05_try.mp4",
          "label": "In the viewport",
          "paragraph": 0,
          "recorded": {
            "blender": "5.2",
            "kneady": "1.0.0"
          }
        }
      ],
      "done_when": [
        {
          "operator": "kneady.drag",
          "with": {
            "target": "Cube",
            "region": 1,
            "button": 0
          },
          "moved": true
        }
      ],
      "start": {
        "view": {
          "location": [
            0.0,
            0.0,
            0.0
          ],
          "rotation": [
            0.71238,
            0.44106,
            0.28736,
            0.46412
          ],
          "distance": 10.0,
          "perspective": "PERSP"
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}
